cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MokkenLab: A jamovi Module for Mokken Scale Analysis"
message: >
  If you use MokkenLab in your research, please cite the software using the
  metadata below, and cite mokken and the methods it implements as listed in
  docs/Bibliography.md.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Chacón Chacón"
    given-names: "Arquímedes De León"
    affiliation: "Universidad Católica Andrés Bello (UCAB), Caracas, Venezuela"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7014-7513"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ArchieJamDev/MokkenLab"
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
version: "0.1.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23955263"
date-released: "2026-11-04"
abstract: >
  MokkenLab is an open-source jamovi module that brings every capability of
  the mokken R package for Mokken scale analysis (nonparametric item response
  theory) to jamovi, pairing every result with evidence-based methodological
  guidance, interpretation and educational support in English and Spanish.
keywords:
  - jamovi
  - Mokken Scale Analysis
  - Nonparametric Item Response Theory
  - Psychometrics
  - mokken
  - Open Science
language: en
